  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/MVS/BH_NU_HEADER.png\" alt=\"橫幅\"></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fD1D8LKA5N\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://ko-fi.com/img/githubbutton_sm.svg\" alt=\"Ko-fi\"></a></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fS5nffJbuvA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/869218732650688543?color=3e72b3&amp;label=DISCORD&amp;style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/finndog_123/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/CurseForge-projects-3e72b3?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge\" alt=\"CurseForge 作品\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fFinnDog_123\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Modrinth-projects-3e72b3?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth\" alt=\"Modrinth 作品\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpreviews.moogsmods.com%252fvoyager-structures%252f1.21.1%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://pub-24a4e0e7ea8544a5b6f73c3a23512589.r2.dev/images/c110cc09347a4f9f9de6c974f2fa35d8.png\" alt=\"查看結構\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/MVS/BH_NU_BANNER1.png\" alt=\"概述\"></p><p>此模組支援 Forge、Fabric、NeoForge 和 Quilt！亦可僅安裝於伺服器端。Forge 支援在 1.20.4 版本後終止。</p><h3>關於</h3><p>Moogs Voyager Structures 透過動態且引人入勝的新結構，改變您的 Minecraft 遊戲體驗。這些結構使用原版方塊與實體打造，能無縫融入遊戲中，提供刺激的戰利品、具挑戰性的敵人以及友善的村民。與任何模組包相容，此模組在保留經典 Minecraft 風格的同時，豐富您的世界。立即深入 Moogs Voyager Structures 的冒險與探索世界吧！</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpreviews.moogsmods.com%252fvoyager-structures%252f1.21.1%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://pub-24a4e0e7ea8544a5b6f73c3a23512589.r2.dev/images/f8fe835413394a76b10a678afefea30f.png\" alt=\"以 3D 方式瀏覽每個結構\"></a></p><h3>配置包</h3><p>模組的每個方面都可透過資料包進行自訂。內含完整說明的範本可於<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mvs-moogs-voyager-structure-config-pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此處</a>找到。</p><p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/MVS/BH_NU_BANNER2.png\" alt=\"特色\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/epC7vBE.png\" alt=\"圖片拼貼\"></p><p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/MVS/BH_NU_BANNER4.png\" alt=\"展示\"></p><h3>影片</h3><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/C6Mzy-1a7Ys\" width=\"650\" height=\"364\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/z0HMHeHAlZ4?wmode=transparent\" width=\"320\" height=\"180\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/8e1M7q9xczE?wmode=transparent\" width=\"320\" height=\"180\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/umTiIV1mpJg?t=21s?wmode=transparent\" width=\"320\" height=\"180\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/twKJIl2pZpI?t=49s?wmode=transparent\" width=\"320\" height=\"180\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/R0MbDUuVNHU?t=420s?wmode=transparent\" width=\"320\" height=\"180\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><h3>模組包</h3><p>查看所有模組包，請點擊<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.modpackindex.com%252fmodpack%252ffinder%253fincluded_mods%253d37802\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此處</a>。</p><p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/MVS/BH_NU_BANNER3.png\" alt=\"橫幅\"> 獲得回覆最快且最佳的方式是加入我們的<a href=\"https://discord.gg/S5nffJbuvA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord 伺服器</a>。</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fmoogsmods%253fr%253dcfmvs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/MVS/BH_NU_PROMO.png\" alt=\"BH 贊助\"></a></p>",
